[179.9706, "o", "Installation complete and verified.\r\n\r\n**Installed:**\r\n- **STP 2.3.3** — built from source and installed to `/usr/local`\r\n- **KLEE 3.2** — built against **LLVM 16.0.6** with the **STP solver** enabled\r\n- uClibc is **not** used\r\n- KLEE headers installed at `/usr/local/include/klee/klee.h`\r\n\r\n**Environment configured in `~/.bashrc`** (placed before the non-interactive early return so `source ~/.bashrc` works):\r\n- `PATH` includes `/usr/local/bin`\r\n- `CPATH` includes `/usr/local/include`\r\n- `LIBRARY_PATH` and `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` include `/usr/local/lib`\r\n\r\n**Verified from a clean, non-interactive shell:**\r\n```\r\nsource ~/.bashrc\r\ncommand -v klee          # /usr/local/bin/klee\r\necho \"$CPATH\"            # /usr/local/include\r\nklee --version           # KLEE 3.2, Ubuntu LLVM version 16.0.6\r\n```\r\nA test program using `#include <klee/klee.h>` compiled successfully without extra `-I` flags, and KLEE ran it reporting:\r\n```\r\nKLEE: Using STP solver backend\r\n```\r\n"]
